              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabina umwami w’i Hasori avyumvise, atuma kuri Yobabu umwami w’i Madoni, no ku mwami w’i Shimuroni, no ku mwami w’i Akishafi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 1:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atuma no ku bami bo mu mugamba w’i burārūko, n’abo mu kiyaya Araba giherereye i Kinereti i bumanuko bgaho, n’abo mu gihugu c’imisozi iciye bugufi, n’abo mu misozi ihagaze y’i Dori ahahera i burengerazuba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atuma no ku Banyakanani b’i burasirazuba n’ab’i burengerazuba, no ku Bamori no ku Baheti no ku Baferizi no ku Bayebusi bo mu mugamba, no ku Bahiwi bo musi ya Herumoni mu gihugu c’i Misipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.7.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 7:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.13.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 13:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bazanana n’ingabo zabo zose; bāri benshi nk’umusenyi wo kw isēsero ry’ikiyaga, bo n’amafarasi n’imikogote vy’isinzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bami bose bakoranira hamwe, baraza basagaza ku mazi y’i Meromu, ngo batere Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
