        {
          "text": "Ico gihe Yosuwa aragenda, ageseza Abanaki bo mu gihugu c’ umugamba, uhereye i Heburoni n’i Debira n’i Anabu, umugamba wose watwaye Abayuda, n’umugamba wose watwaye Abisirayeli; Yosuwa arabarandura rwose, bo n’ibisagara vyabo. ",
